WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:01.290
Speaker 1: All right.

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:06.259
Let's talk about this bizarre change, but
welcome change over the last month, maybe

00:00:06.259 --> 00:00:13.210
ninety six hours in which many Republicans
and some right wing media figures have started

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.400
talking about go get vaccinated.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.700
The vaccine is good.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:17.700
The vaccine is safe.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.450
The vaccine will keep most people alive, not
everybody.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:28.520
So even though the headlines has been the
headlines have been Fox News goes, provosts,

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:33.300
Republicans go provosts, people like Marjorie
Taylor Green, people like Tucker Carlson,

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.510
they've continued to do the Antibalas stuff.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.390
But there is a real question, which is why
is this all of a sudden happening?

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:46.730
There's a great article in The Atlantic by
David Graham called Suddenly Conservatives

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:47.829
Care About Vaccines.

00:00:47.829 --> 00:00:51.620
A number of leaders on the right suddenly
urge their audiences to get vaccinated in

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:52.690
the past day.

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:54.540
Why now?

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:59.860
And there is there are a number of different
ideas proposed here.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:06.210
And the article goes through Hannity saying
that you've got to take this seriously.

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:11.700
Steve Doocy saying if you have a chance, get
the shot, it will save your life.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.900
Ben Shapiro saying, get the facts.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:16.950
I did, my wife did, my parents did.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:22.910
Newsmax CEO Christopher Ruddy saying Joe Biden
should be applauded for making a dent in the

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.520
covid pandemic.

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:31.350
House Minority Whip Steve Scalise, who has
had conspicuously declined to get a shot,

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:34.400
announced he finally did get vaccinated.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:41.600
And there is a clear shift in tone, as David
Graham writes in the Atlantic article, but

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:46.530
it's not exactly clear why it's happening.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:51.780
One suggestion, as reported by CNN's Cantlon
Collins, was that there have been regular

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:57.220
high level conversations between the White
House and Fox News regarding pandemic and

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:58.950
vaccine coverage.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:02.840
But Fox quickly denied that report.

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:08.250
Another possibility is simply that the covid
surge, fueled by the Delta variant, is making

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:12.910
some of these Republicans realize the hospitals
are getting overloaded, we could be looking

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:16.969
at lockdown's being reinstated here as they
are around the world.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:21.810
And all of a sudden, when the stock market
dropped precipitously on Monday, even though

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:27.249
it more than recovered on Tuesday and Wednesday,
Republicans all of a sudden cared.

00:02:27.249 --> 00:02:34.099
The other real possibility is that Republicans
might be doing the math that many of you have

00:02:34.099 --> 00:02:38.730
been doing who write to me and say, David,
if you have dramatically higher vaccination

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:44.450
rates among Democrats than among Republicans,
could this have an electoral impact in the

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:49.510
sense that Republicans are going to kill off
too many of their own voters because they

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:53.090
are the ones not getting vaccinated and it
will cause them to lose elections?

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:57.579
Like, could it be as simple as dead people
can't vote?

00:02:57.579 --> 00:02:58.689
I don't know.

00:02:58.689 --> 00:03:03.430
I don't know, because even with that, you
have the conspiracy of I got some emails about

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:09.159
this a couple of days ago, people writing
to me saying, David, you people aren't doing

00:03:09.159 --> 00:03:11.639
a good job of lying about the vaccine.

00:03:11.639 --> 00:03:14.510
This this is the view of a right wing conspiracy
theorist.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:19.650
It's a little too suspicious that mostly unvaccinated
people are getting sick and dying.

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:20.909
That must be part of the conspiracy.

00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:25.370
And it's like, no, it's that the vaccines
work really well at preventing death.

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:31.719
So it makes sense that it's mostly unvaccinated
people that are getting sick and dying.

00:03:31.719 --> 00:03:38.939
A couple of instances here of such a pro vaccine,
statements from people we might not expect

00:03:38.939 --> 00:03:39.939
it from.

00:03:39.939 --> 00:03:42.780
And then I'm going to get to another possibility
that might explain what's going on.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:48.370
Here's Florida Republican governor just making,
you know, known as covid Jesus to some people,

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:53.629
the guy who ignored every guideline early
on and said have full capacity boxing, wrestling,

00:03:53.629 --> 00:03:55.219
everything in Florida.

00:03:55.219 --> 00:03:56.730
Here he is making a lot of sense.

00:03:56.730 --> 00:04:00.540
Speaker 2: So here's, I think, the most important
thing with the data.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:01.540
Yeah.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:07.629
If you are vaccinated, fully vaccinated, the
chance of you getting seriously ill or dying

00:04:07.629 --> 00:04:11.290
from covid is effectively zero.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:16.880
If you look at the people that are being admitted
to hospitals, over 95 percent of them are

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:20.080
either not fully vaccinated or not vaccinated
at all.

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.080
Indeed.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:24.560
So these vaccines are saving lives.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.800
They are reducing mortality.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:31.060
Mortality in nursing homes since we rolled
out the vaccines in December is down over

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:33.000
95 percent.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.270
So a really,
Speaker 1: really strong pro vaccine statement.

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:41.230
And it could be motivated, again, by the fact
that Florida has had a big upsurge and now

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:46.730
represents the one state of Florida is one
out of five covid cases in the entire country.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:48.780
Here is Mitch McConnell pleading for the vaccine.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.260
Speaker 4: Get vaccinated,
Speaker 2: McConnell.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:59.080
On that note, the Republican governor of Utah
said this weekend that conservative talking

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:03.810
heads are, quote, literally killing their
supporters.

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:08.010
Would you speak out against people who are
actually speaking out?

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:10.221
Well, Nancy, I
Speaker 4: don't know how I could be any more

00:05:10.221 --> 00:05:11.800
clear than I have been.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:17.910
I've been saying the same thing about vaccinations
all along the way.

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.690
Others can say whatever they choose to say.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:26.760
But this is something I think I'm a good example
of, something I know the answer to.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:33.220
It is not at all clear that the way to avoid
getting back in the hospital is to get vaccinated

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:38.550
and want to encourage everybody to do that
and to ignore all of these other voices.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:41.580
Speaker 1: So what do you think explains this?

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.080
What do you think explains the change?

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:48.090
You know, if it was only Fox News, even though
they've denied conversation with the White

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:51.340
House, has there could there have been some
promise of access?

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:52.340
Right.

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:53.340
This is how stuff works.

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:56.560
Listen, we will give you a Joe Biden town
hall.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:06:01.450
If you guys really help us promote vaccines,
that would be completely plausible the way

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:03.140
media works.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:05.770
But it's not just FOX News that's doing it.

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:08.370
And also, FOX has denied conversations with
the White House.

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:11.580
They may be lying, but let's assume they're
telling the truth.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:17.030
Is it as simple as the Republicans are realizing
that it's disproportionately their voters

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:18.030
that are dying?

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:21.030
Is it simply motivated by self-preservation?

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:24.850
I don't know the answer, but I'm curious to
hear from you.

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:27.190
What do you think explains this change in
tone?

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.440
And remember, it's not a total shift.

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:33.210
Even during these last few days, we've still
seen the anti back stuff from some Republican

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:35.640
members of Congress, from some on Fox News.

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:39.980
So it's not a 180 degree change, but it is
definitely a change in tone.

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:41.120
Let me know your thoughts.

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:46.120
We'll have more about this on our Instagram,
which you can find at David Pakman show.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:08:00.919
Find me on Instagram at David Pakman as well.

